Script: `analysis/q9_elicitation_analysis.py` (Python 3.12, pandas 3.0.2, numpy default_rng).
Run: `python3 analysis/q9_elicitation_analysis.py`

## Coding found in the file (not the documented Likert scale)
* `'quoted'` = technique used/mentioned (ONLY affirmative category; Q9 has no frequency Likert here)
* `'not quoted'` = not used
* `'-77'` = skipped whole Q9 block — exactly the same 82 rows in all 6 items (verified), so exclusion
  keeps one common denominator (n=194) for every technique ⇒ no differential bias
* `'-99'` / `'-66'` = NA codes inside free-text `*_Free` columns

